  "label": "The younger woman is mapped as the 'I' in the joke about gender swapping.",
  "description": "The text 'it started when i ls swapped my mustang' implies that the younger woman (who appears to be the subject of the joke) is the one who 'swapped' her gender. The visual of the younger woman is mapped onto the textual 'I' in the joke, creating an analogical mapping where she is the agent of the gender swap action described in the text.",
